OL,3,GNEWSACamp leader who abused boys to
OL,4,Achallenge sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA summer camp leader who sexually
OL,7,Fassaulted boys after giving them sweets
OL,8,Flaced with tranquiliser is to appeal
OL,9,Fagainst his prison sentence.
OL,11,FJon Ruben was jailed for 23 years and
OL,12,F10 months in February after his
OL,13,Foffending came to light when several
OL,14,Fchildren fell ill at a camp he was
OL,15,Frunning in Stathern, Leicestershire, in
OL,16,FJuly 2025.
OL,18,FLeicester Crown Court heard the former
OL,19,Fvet, teacher and church worker had used
OL,20,F"the cloak of Christianity" to target
OL,21,Fvulnerable children.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
